    # "As I'm struggling to tie mine on, I notice Cassius standing in the doorway, something shiny and flashing with lights in his paw."
    "Dum meum aegre alligo, Cassium in limine stantem animadverto, re lucida luminibusque micante in manu."

# game/a2s1.rpy:589
translate latin a2s1_58d7a0d9:

    # "He doesn't have the usual sour look on his face though."
    "Sed solitus amarus vultus ei deest."

# game/a2s1.rpy:590
translate latin a2s1_3e017342:

    # "Instead, he almost looks scared."
    "Paene timere videtur."

# game/a2s1.rpy:591
translate latin a2s1_30216102:

    # "Cato lets us stand in silence for a moment before turning his head toward the door."
    "Cato nos paulisper tacitos stare sinit, deinde caput ad ianuam vertit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:592
translate latin a2s1_b173796b:

    # ca "\"Felix! Enter!\""
    ca "\"Felix! Intra!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:593
translate latin a2s1_00016bcb:

    # "I hear shuffling around out in the hallway and Cassius moves to the side to allow a neatly-robed wolf to enter."
    "Vestigia foris in ambulacro audio; Cassius in latus cedit ut lupus toga decenter indutus intret."

# game/a2s1.rpy:594
translate latin a2s1_321b1550:

    # "He looks about as old as Cato, though nowhere near as big."
    "Tam senex quam Cato videtur, quamquam minime tam magnus."

# game/a2s1.rpy:595
translate latin a2s1_8cbee3c2:

    # "He moves timidly, looking about with his ears down."
    "Timide movetur, circumspiciens, auribus demissis."

# game/a2s1.rpy:596
translate latin a2s1_7e31dc94:

    # "Felix" "\"Y—yes, your Imperial Majesty?\""
    "Felix" "\"I—ita, Maiestas Imperialis?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:597
translate latin a2s1_7d2029ee:

    # ca "\"Is that the alien you treated for avian pox?\""
    ca "\"Ille est alienigena quem a variola avia curavisti?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:598
translate latin a2s1_9badfd85:

    # "Cato jerks his head at me, keeping his eyes on Felix."
    "Cato capite me significat, oculis in Felice fixis."

# game/a2s1.rpy:599
translate latin a2s1_0cf0feb3:

    # "Felix turns to look at me, and I can tell that he's trying to think of the right thing to say."
    "Felix se vertit ut me spectet, et intellego eum recta verba excogitare conari."

# game/a2s1.rpy:600
translate latin a2s1_81c13580:

    # "Finally, he just gulps and nods his head."
    "Tandem tantum deglutit et capite annuit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:601
translate latin a2s1_477c4f6c:

    # "Felix" "\"Yes, I treated him three nights ago for avian pox.\""
    "Felix" "\"Ita, eum ante tres noctes a variola avia curavi.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:602
translate latin a2s1_d7fd4423:

    # ca "\"And his species had no profile?\""
    ca "\"Et species eius nullas notas descriptas habebat?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:603
translate latin a2s1_8303c843:

    # "Felix" "\"N—no, I could only tell that he was a primate...how...how is he conscious—\""
    "Felix" "\"N—non; tantum intellegere potui eum primatem esse...quo...quomodo conscius est—\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:604
translate latin a2s1_1266095f:

    # ca "\"Com, escort Felix to the dungeons.\""
    ca "\"Computatrum, Felicem ad carceres comitare.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:606
translate latin a2s1_eefe4817:

    # com "\"Yes, Cato\""
    com "\"Ita, Cato\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:607
translate latin a2s1_a1ee88df:

    # "Felix" "\"What? Why!? Why to the dungeons...Your Majesty?\""
    "Felix" "\"Quid? Cur!? Cur ad carceres...Maiestas?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:608
translate latin a2s1_bdf59f1d:

    # "Felix looks imploringly at Cato before the probes enter."
    "Felix supplex Catonem spectat antequam automata intrant."

# game/a2s1.rpy:609
translate latin a2s1_e28456c5:

    # com "\"Proceed to the hall or risk being shot, Felix.\""
    com "\"In ambulacrum procede, aut ictum periclitaris, Felix.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:610
translate latin a2s1_96887a46:

    # "Felix" "\"Please, what is happening?\""
    "Felix" "\"Quaeso, quid accidit?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:611
translate latin a2s1_b51f9c67:

    # "Even while he speaks, Felix backs away out of the room, Cato completely ignoring him."
    "Dum adhuc loquitur, Felix retro e cubiculo cedit, Catone eum omnino neglegente."

# game/a2s1.rpy:612
translate latin a2s1_07248ae5:

    # "We all listen to the doctor's stumbling steps out in the echoing hall, the wolf making an attempt to ask Cassius what's happening before things fall silent again."
    "Omnes vestigia titubantis medici in ambulacro resonante audimus; lupus Cassium quid accidat rogare conatur, antequam rursus omnia silent."

# game/a2s1.rpy:613
translate latin a2s1_513bde08:

    # ca "\"Cassius, come in and close the door.\""
    ca "\"Cassi, intra et ianuam claude.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:616
translate latin a2s1_fdc61f8a:

    # "Cassius, looking even more scared now, steps inside and allows the door to close."
    "Cassius, iam etiam timidior, intrat et ianuam claudi sinit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:617
translate latin a2s1_5aafb82e:

    # "Cato stares at the two of us."
    "Cato ambos nos intuetur."

# game/a2s1.rpy:618
translate latin a2s1_2a343048:

    # "At this point, Amicus has one paw on my arm, keeping me firmly halfway behind his back."
    "Iam Amicus unam manum bracchio meo imposuit, me firme partim post tergum suum tenens."

# game/a2s1.rpy:619
translate latin a2s1_493cc6eb:

    # "I'm still able to look around his shoulder at the furious acting emperor."
    "Adhuc circa umerum eius ad furiosum imperatorem interim regentem spectare possum."

# game/a2s1.rpy:620
translate latin a2s1_ed7f284d:

    # "Slowly, I'm starting to realize what might be happening right now, and Cato's next words confirm it."
    "Lente intellegere incipio quid nunc accidat; proxima Catonis verba confirmant."

# game/a2s1.rpy:622
translate latin a2s1_9873b79a:

    # ca "\"Amicus...did you make First Contact?\""
    ca "\"Amice...Primum Contactum fecisti?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:623
translate latin a2s1_a8bb45f1:

    # "Amicus is silent for a beat, but responds in a strong, confident voice."
    "Amicus paulisper tacet, sed forti fidentique voce respondet."

# game/a2s1.rpy:625
translate latin a2s1_3377036d:

    # a "\"No, of course not. What in the world are you talking about, Cato?\""
    a "\"Non, certe non. Quid tandem dicis, Cato?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:626
translate latin a2s1_c5a4f885:

    # "Cato stares, jaw clenched, then screams at us at a volume I didn't think he was capable of."
    "Cato intuetur, maxilla contracta; tum ad nos clamat tanto sono quanto eum posse non putabam."

# game/a2s1.rpy:630
translate latin a2s1_d3478a4f:

    # ca "\"DO NOT PLAY GAMES WITH ME AMICUS!\""
    ca "\"NOLI MECUM LUDERE, AMICE!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:631
translate latin a2s1_188e6a67:

    # "To his credit, Amicus only jumps a little bit, his grip still firmly on my arm."
    "Laude dignum est quod Amicus tantum paulum subsilit, bracchio meo adhuc firme tento."

# game/a2s1.rpy:632
translate latin a2s1_450bf4ee:

    # "The silence that follows rings in my ears as Cato seems to work to calm himself down."
    "Silentium sequens in auribus meis resonat, dum Cato se sedare conari videtur."

# game/a2s1.rpy:633
translate latin a2s1_e0d0de33:

    # "When he speaks again, his voice is barely above a whisper."
    "Cum rursus loquitur, vox eius vix susurro maior est."

# game/a2s1.rpy:635
translate latin a2s1_9b460064:

    # ca "\"He is un-profiled. ALL children, abandoned or not, are profiled. He is not a Simian, so WHAT is he?\""
    ca "\"Notae eius descriptae non sunt. OMNIUM Liberorum, desertorum necne, notae descriptae sunt. Simianus non est; itaque QUID est?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:636
translate latin a2s1_d06cc8c0:

    # "Amicus is frozen, and I feel my stomach drop, like I'm going to piss myself."
    "Amicus immobilis est, et ventrem meum concidere sentio, quasi me ipsum permingam."

# game/a2s1.rpy:637
translate latin a2s1_99b360d5:

    # "I see Cato working his jaw."
    "Catonem maxillam moventem video."

# game/a2s1.rpy:639
translate latin a2s1_34cb7814:

    # ca "\"And is it true he's your lover?\""
    ca "\"Et verum est eum amantem tuum esse?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:640
translate latin a2s1_20cafd48:

    # "Lover?"
    "Amantem?"

# game/a2s1.rpy:641
translate latin a2s1_428ac9e9:

    # "How would he know anything about that?"
    "Quomodo quidquam de ea re sciret?"

# game/a2s1.rpy:642
translate latin a2s1_dc75e69c:

    # "Amicus doesn't answer this time, and that seems to be enough for Cato."
    "Hoc tempore Amicus non respondet, quod Catoni satis esse videtur."

# game/a2s1.rpy:643
translate latin a2s1_37cc37b8:

    # ca "\"Fine, do not answer. We will take the correct precautions. COM!\""
    ca "\"Bene, noli respondere. Rectas cautiones adhibebimus. COMPUTATRUM!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:644
translate latin a2s1_d4c6c7d2:

    # com "\"Yes, Cato?\""
    com "\"Ita, Cato?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:645
translate latin a2s1_bda0d412:

    # ca "\"Terminate [mc].\""
    ca "\"[mc] interfice.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:647
translate latin a2s1_99386a39:

    # a "\"NO!\""
    a "\"NON!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:649
translate latin a2s1_d3415d64:

    # "Amicus simultaneously throws himself in front of me while reaching back and hugging me to him with both paws, backing me against the wall."
    "Amicus simul ante me se iacit et retro manus porrigit, me ambabus sibi amplectens, me ad parietem retrudens."

# game/a2s1.rpy:650
translate latin a2s1_2e713318:

    # "Drones begin to enter the bedroom, but Cato barks out another order."
    "Automata cubiculum intrare incipiunt, sed Cato aliud imperium exclamat."

# game/a2s1.rpy:651
translate latin a2s1_094bdf44:

    # ca "\"Pause last directive!\""
    ca "\"Ultimum imperium suspende!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:652
translate latin a2s1_81fc410d:

    # com "\"Pausing last directive.\""
    com "\"Ultimum imperium suspenditur.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:653
translate latin a2s1_6f7e5450:

    # "My view is obscured now, but I can hear Amicus's heavy breathing, his heart hammering so hard that I can feel it through his back."
    "Iam aspectus meus obscuratus est, sed gravem spiritum Amici audire possum; cor eius tam vehementer pulsat ut per tergum sentiam."

# game/a2s1.rpy:654
translate latin a2s1_bdf2f0cc:

    # "Once again, Cato allows the silence to stretch out before speaking."
    "Rursus Cato silentium extendi sinit antequam loquitur."

# game/a2s1.rpy:656
translate latin a2s1_d4a7491e:

    # ca "\"Then tell us the truth, Amicus.\""
    ca "\"Ergo verum nobis dic, Amice.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:658
translate latin a2s1_2b7889cf:

    # a "\"You must not harm him! Otherwise, I will give you nothing and...and I'll have you thrown in the dungeon when I become emperor!\""
    a "\"Eum laedere non debes! Alioquin nihil tibi dabo et...et te in carcerem conici iubebo cum imperator ero!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:659
translate latin a2s1_486859e8:

    # "More silence."
    "Plus silentii."

# game/a2s1.rpy:660
translate latin a2s1_4fb3cb53:

    # "I wince, wondering how that could have possibly been the right thing to say."
    "Horresco, miratus quomodo haec recta verba esse potuerint."

# game/a2s1.rpy:661
translate latin a2s1_4d3c2608:

    # "Then I hear a low growling sound, one I'm sure is coming from Cato."
    "Tum gravem fremitum audio, quem certe a Catone venire puto."

# game/a2s1.rpy:663
translate latin a2s1_d8107c7b:

    # ca "\"How dare you. You think you'll become emperor after this? In fact...\""
    ca "\"Quomodo audes. Putas te post haec imperatorem futurum? Immo...\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:664
translate latin a2s1_07135f2d:

    # "I hear a quick movement and the next thing I know, Amicus is wrenched from in front of me."
    "Celerem motum audio; tum subito Amicus a loco ante me avellitur."

# game/a2s1.rpy:670
translate latin a2s1_d0ef78f4:

    # "I watch as he slides across the floor before Cato pounces on him, pinning him there."
    "Eum per solum labi specto, antequam Cato in eum insilit et ibi premit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:671
translate latin a2s1_f6b177e7:

    # ca "\"Cassius! Grab the alien! Set the nervo to lethal.\""
    ca "\"Cassi! Alienigenam cape! Nervo ad mortiferum gradum dispone.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:672
translate latin a2s1_e2e6512c:

    # a "\"NO! PLEASE!\""
    a "\"NON! QUAESO!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:673
translate latin a2s1_aff36bde:

    # "I'm frozen, but I manage to look over at Cassius who seems just as frozen as I am, holding up the nervo in his trembling paws."
    "Immobilis sum, sed ad Cassium spectare possum, qui tam immobilis quam ego videtur, Nervo manibus trementibus sustinens."

# game/a2s1.rpy:674
translate latin a2s1_a1663e36:

    # ca "\"MOVE YOU IDIOT!\""
    ca "\"MOVE TE, STULTE!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:676
translate latin a2s1_f2aa00ab:

    # "Cassius jumps and hurries over to me."
    "Cassius subsilit et ad me festinat."

# game/a2s1.rpy:677
translate latin a2s1_7f62d2a5:

    # "I start to pull away, but he grabs me up in an awkward hold, setting the nervo against my neck."
    "Recedere incipio, sed me inepte capit, Nervo cervici meae admovens."

# game/a2s1.rpy:678
translate latin a2s1_37b23412:

    # a "\"NOOO!\""
    a "\"NOOON!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:679
translate latin a2s1_3b3677e6:

    # "Amicus's struggles double and Cato is bucked around like he's on a mechanical bull."
    "Luctatus Amici duplicantur, et Cato huc illuc iactatur quasi in tauro mechanico sit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:680
translate latin a2s1_95ce9df7:

    # ca "\"Cease struggling, Amicus! He will not be harmed if you do as I say!\""
    ca "\"Desine luctari, Amice! Non laedetur si facis quod dico!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:681
translate latin a2s1_9eb06cbf:

    # "Amicus seems to calm down a bit at that, panting wetly against the floor as he looks straight at me, face full of desperation."
    "His verbis Amicus paulum quiescere videtur, umide contra solum anhelans dum recta me spectat, vultu pleno desperationis."

# game/a2s1.rpy:682
translate latin a2s1_19a9e000:

    # ca "\"You've proven yourself to be an incompetent fool, even moreso than I'd originally thought. You've endangered our entire empire. For this, you will not become emperor, rules be damned.\""
    ca "\"Te stultum ineptumque demonstravisti, etiam magis quam initio putabam. Totum imperium nostrum in periculum adduxisti. Ideo imperator non fies, leges maledictae sint.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:683
translate latin a2s1_55ca1958:

    # ca "\"It's a wonder how you thought you'd get away with this. It can only be a miracle that the monitors have not found out, and they surely would if you became emperor with that...thing.\""
    ca "\"Mirum est quomodo putaveris te impune hoc facturum. Tantum miraculum esse potest Monitores nondum comperisse; certe comperirent si cum illa...re imperator fieres.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:684
translate latin a2s1_4248c80b:

    # "Cato stands and wrenches Amicus to his feet, twisting the other wolf's paws behind his back hard enough that Amicus lets out a bark of pain."
    "Cato surgit et Amicum in pedes trahit, manus alterius lupi post tergum tam vehementer torquens ut Amicus dolore latret."

# game/a2s1.rpy:687
translate latin a2s1_3a1b161c:

    # ca "\"The third trial begins today. You will lose, and Cassius will become emperor.\""
    ca "\"Tertium certamen hodie incipit. Vinceris, et Cassius imperator fiet.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:688
translate latin a2s1_2cc5db7e:

    # "Cato begins to push Amicus to the doorway."
    "Cato Amicum ad ianuam propellere incipit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:689
translate latin a2s1_4b048293:

    # ca "\"Do as I say, and I will let the alien live, otherwise we can do all of this in the most unpleasant way possible, understand?\""
    ca "\"Fac quod dico, et alienigenam vivere sinam; alioquin omnia haec pessimo modo fieri possunt. Intellegis?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:690
translate latin a2s1_2fa3934e:

    # "Amicus is quiet until Cato shakes him by his pinned arms."
    "Amicus tacet donec Cato eum bracchiis captis quatit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:691
translate latin a2s1_04c6f97b:

    # a "\"Agh!...Yes.\""
    a "\"Agh!...Ita.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:692
translate latin a2s1_bedf5f88:

    # ca "\"Good, now to the amphitheater. We will do this quickly. Do not make any stupid moves otherwise I will let the drones escort you instead.\""
    ca "\"Bene, nunc ad amphitheatrum. Hoc cito faciemus. Noli stulte quidquam facere, alioquin automata te comitari iubebo.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:693
translate latin a2s1_4dc2ea1e:

    # "Cato presses Amicus toward the door."
    "Cato Amicum ad ianuam premit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:695
translate latin a2s1_b9835468:

    # "I see Amicus glance back at me, the look on his face one of utter helplessness."
    "Amicum ad me respicere video, vultu omnem impotentiam ostendente."

# game/a2s1.rpy:700
translate latin a2s1_997717a9:

    # "They're out the door by the time Cassius realizes he's supposed to be following."
    "Iam per ianuam egressi sunt cum Cassius intellegit se sequi debere."

# game/a2s1.rpy:701
translate latin a2s1_9b40b91a:

    # "He jumps before awkwardly pushing me after them."
    "Subsilit et me inepte post eos propellit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:705
translate latin a2s1_61901e3e:

    # "It's already sunset when we get to the amphitheater."
    "Iam sol occidit cum ad amphitheatrum pervenimus."

# game/a2s1.rpy:706
translate latin a2s1_af9a261d:

    # "We must have slept for most of the day."
    "Sine dubio maiorem diei partem dormivimus."

# game/a2s1.rpy:707
translate latin a2s1_50ed3ff9:

    # "Amicus and Cato are already standing in the center of the amphitheater as Cassius struggles to move me down the steps."
    "Amicus et Cato iam in medio amphitheatro stant, dum Cassius me aegre per gradus demovet."

# game/a2s1.rpy:709
translate latin a2s1_281a0d65:

    # ca "\"Sit him down, Cassius, and get down here!\""
    ca "\"Eum sedere fac, Cassi, et huc descende!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:710
translate latin a2s1_1cc90c7b:

    # "Shakily, Cassius plants me down on one of the stone steps before suddenly undressing."
    "Tremens Cassius me in uno gradu lapideo ponit, deinde subito vestimenta exuit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:711
translate latin a2s1_065d63b6:

    # "That's when I notice that he's tucked the nervo into his waistband."
    "Tum animadverto eum Nervo in cingulo condidisse."

# game/a2s1.rpy:712
translate latin a2s1_34907649:

    # "Possibly because of the frantic nature of the whole situation, Cassius seems to have forgotten it, and I watch it fall into his clothing as he drops it from his waist."
    "Fortasse quia tota res tam tumultuosa est, Cassius eius oblitus videtur; specto illud in vestimenta cadere dum ea a lumbis demittit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:713
translate latin a2s1_53a22be5:

    # "He then stumbles his way down to the center."
    "Tum titubans ad medium descendit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:714
translate latin a2s1_fca7e095:

    # "Amicus, meanwhile, stands stiffly next to Cato, his paws clenched, and I feel my heart sink as I see the look on his face."
    "Interea Amicus rigide iuxta Catonem stat, manibus contractis; cor meum concidere sentio cum vultum eius video."

# game/a2s1.rpy:715
translate latin a2s1_5fa5f923:

    # "He has no idea what to do."
    "Omnino nescit quid agat."

# game/a2s1.rpy:716
translate latin a2s1_b119e3b4:

    # "Several camera drones had followed us to the amphitheater, their lights glowing an ominous red."
    "Aliquot automata cameram ferentia nos ad amphitheatrum secuta erant, luminibus sinistro rubore lucentibus."

# game/a2s1.rpy:717
translate latin a2s1_19d5b5ee:

    # "For several moments, Cato watches them arrange themselves around the small theater, their lenses flashing in the fading light."
    "Aliquamdiu Cato ea circum parvum theatrum se disponere spectat, lentibus in luce languescente micantibus."

# game/a2s1.rpy:719
translate latin a2s1_93838197:

    # c "\"Cato?\""
    c "\"Cato?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:720
translate latin a2s1_fbabd6bb:

    # ca "\"What, Cassius?\""
    ca "\"Quid, Cassi?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:721
translate latin a2s1_cdbb0b89:

    # c "\"There was no trial scheduled for today...how will this be broadcast anywhere?\""
    c "\"Nullum certamen in hunc diem constitutum erat...quomodo usquam hoc transmittetur?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:722
translate latin a2s1_1af8dc5a:

    # ca "\"This will not be live. I'll think of a reason to tell the people later. We only need a single clip of you being victorious.\""
    ca "\"Non statim transmittetur. Causam postea populo dicendam excogitabo. Tantum brevi imagine tui victoris nobis opus est.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:724
translate latin a2s1_64fd0416:

    # a "\"They will never believe this.\""
    a "\"Hoc numquam credent.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:725
translate latin a2s1_1781931a:

    # "Though Amicus is putting on a brave face, I can hear his voice shaking."
    "Quamquam Amicus fortem vultum praebet, vocem eius tremere audio."

# game/a2s1.rpy:726
translate latin a2s1_78f27334:

    # ca "\"{i}Pugnu{/i} is a combination of skill and luck, and it's not always the strongest that wins. We will manage.\""
    ca "\"{i}Pugnu{/i} ex arte et fortuna constat; non semper fortissimus vincit. Rem conficiemus.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:727
translate latin a2s1_a81b623d:

    # a "\"And how—\""
    a "\"Et quomodo—\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:731
translate latin a2s1_b024f6b1:

    # "Cato suddenly whirls on Amicus, throwing a punch so hard into his jaw that the other wolf spins almost 360 degrees before collapsing on the hard floor of the amphitheater."
    "Cato subito ad Amicum se vertit, maxillam eius tam vehementer pugno feriens ut alter lupus paene plenum in orbem convertatur antequam in duro amphitheatri solo corruit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:732
translate latin a2s1_d07a0c60:

    # "I'm standing up without even remembering doing so, heart hammering in my throat as I look down at Amicus."
    "Sto, ne memini quidem me surrexisse, corde in gutture pulsante dum Amicum deorsum specto."

# game/a2s1.rpy:733
translate latin a2s1_66b2abd9:

    # "He doesn't move."
    "Non movetur."

# game/a2s1.rpy:734
translate latin a2s1_b19fe24b:

    # "Meanwhile, Cato shakes his paw lightly, like it only stung a little bit."
    "Interea Cato manum leniter quatit, quasi tantum paulum doluerit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:735
translate latin a2s1_a765a8c6:

    # "Cassius, on the other hand, is clasping both his ears in his paws, staring down at his brother in a mix of shock and horror."
    "Cassius autem ambas aures manibus tenet, fratrem deorsum spectans, stupore et horrore mixtis."

# game/a2s1.rpy:737
translate latin a2s1_da2bcd32:

    # c "\"C—Cato! What are you doing!?\""
    c "\"C—Cato! Quid facis!?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:739
translate latin a2s1_2b796e96:

    # ca "\"Making it look more authentic, is all.\""
    ca "\"Tantum rem veriorem videri facio.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:740
translate latin a2s1_de3b4725:

    # "Amicus stirs on the ground then, groaning and pushing himself up."
    "Tum Amicus in solo movetur, gemens atque se erigens."

# game/a2s1.rpy:741
translate latin a2s1_1f7da7fd:

    # "I see dark spots forming under his face, blood dripping from his nose."
    "Maculas obscuras sub facie eius fieri video, sanguine e naso stillante."

# game/a2s1.rpy:742
translate latin a2s1_7da70d1e:

    # "A camera drone drifts down slowly, filming Amicus as he spits blood."
    "Automaton cameram ferens lente descendit, Amicum sanguinem expuentem excipiens."

# game/a2s1.rpy:743
translate latin a2s1_b65b46b5:

    # "I realize then that I have to do something."
    "Tum intellego me aliquid facere debere."

# game/a2s1.rpy:744
translate latin a2s1_37afe5ab:

    # "I've been told to sit on the sidelines for far too long."
    "Nimis diu mihi dictum est me extra res manere debere."

# game/a2s1.rpy:745
translate latin a2s1_cdd159bd:

    # "And I'm not entirely convinced that I'm going to be okay after this."
    "Nec omnino persuasum habeo me post haec incolumem fore."

# game/a2s1.rpy:746
translate latin a2s1_dbdbe876:

    # "I'm a risk to the entire empire."
    "Totum imperium in periculum adduco."

# game/a2s1.rpy:747
translate latin a2s1_8a478f57:

    # "Why would Cato let me live after I'm done being useful?"
    "Cur Cato me vivere sinat postquam ei utilis esse desino?"

# game/a2s1.rpy:748
translate latin a2s1_d1f2c404:

    # "I {i}have{/i} to do something."
    "Aliquid facere {i}debeo{/i}."

# game/a2s1.rpy:749
translate latin a2s1_daeda287:

    # "So I quietly sit back down and lean over to reach into Cassius's pile of clothes, quickly finding the nervo and pulling it out."
    "Itaque tacite rursus sedeo et inclino ut in acervum vestimentorum Cassii manum demittam; cito Nervo invenio atque extraho."

# game/a2s1.rpy:750
translate latin a2s1_5259f4a6:

    # "Then I stand back up again to take a step downward, and no one seems to notice."
    "Tum rursus surgo ut unum gradum descendam; nemo animadvertere videtur."

# game/a2s1.rpy:751
translate latin a2s1_da191834:

    # ca "\"Come on Amicus, get up. You need to grapple with Cass.\""
    ca "\"Age, Amice, surge. Cum Cass luctari debes.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:753
translate latin a2s1_4ffbc464:

    # c "\"Why didn't we just use makeup instead?\""
    c "\"Cur potius pigmentis non usi sumus?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:754
translate latin a2s1_00ed625c:

    # ca "\"There is no time.\""
    ca "\"Tempus non est.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:755
translate latin a2s1_681b0973:

    # "Cato finally bends down to grab Amicus under the arms and heave him up to his feet, the big wolf left to stumble unsteadily, blood running down his chin."
    "Cato tandem inclinat ut Amicum sub bracchiis capiat et in pedes tollat; magnus lupus incerte titubat, sanguine per mentum fluente."

# game/a2s1.rpy:756
translate latin a2s1_e950cb10:

    # ca "\"Cassius, get Amicus in an ankle lock and drop him. That should be enough.\""
    ca "\"Cassi, talum Amici ita prehende ut eum movere non possit, ipsumque deice. Id satis esse debet.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:761
translate latin a2s1_dbd08027:

    # "They set up their scene, even though Amicus seems almost completely out of it."
    "Scaenam suam parant, quamquam Amicus paene omnino inscius videtur."

# game/a2s1.rpy:762
translate latin a2s1_2886a1fa:

    # "All of them are distracted, and I realize that this might be my only chance."
    "Omnes alibi occupati sunt; intellego hanc fortasse solam facultatem meam esse."

# game/a2s1.rpy:763
translate latin a2s1_c5951b7c:

    # "Slowly, I take one step at a time, down toward the center of the amphitheater."
    "Lente singulos gradus descendo, ad medium amphitheatrum."

# game/a2s1.rpy:764
translate latin a2s1_a16c891c:

    # "Meanwhile, Cassius is struggling to pick up Amicus's leg, almost losing his own balance as he does."
    "Interea Cassius crus Amici aegre tollit, paene aequilibrio suo amisso."

# game/a2s1.rpy:765
translate latin a2s1_e43b17c9:

    # "After that, Cato tells Amicus to fall back, which the wolf does, slowly."
    "Postea Cato Amicum retro cadere iubet, quod lupus lente facit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:766
translate latin a2s1_08e04f0f:

    # "Cassius pins him on the ground after that, and I don't think it looks convincing at all."
    "Tum Cassius eum in solo premit; non puto rem omnino verisimilem videri."

# game/a2s1.rpy:767
translate latin a2s1_285277fc:

    # "But that doesn't really matter now as I'm only a few steps from the ground floor."
    "Sed nunc nihil refert, quia tantum paucos gradus ab imo solo absum."

# game/a2s1.rpy:768
translate latin a2s1_6fb70e4f:

    # ca "\"Now, stand and raise your paws in victory, Cass. Look proud.\""
    ca "\"Nunc surge et manus in victoria tolle, Cass. Superbus videare.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:769
translate latin a2s1_db2d9f3e:

    # "At this moment, things start to move in slow-motion."
    "Hoc momento res lente moveri incipiunt."

# game/a2s1.rpy:770
translate latin a2s1_3ecae6a6:

    # "Amicus is flat on his back, but he's looking right at me."
    "Amicus supinus iacet, sed recta me spectat."

# game/a2s1.rpy:771
translate latin a2s1_d9c08ff6:

    # "There's a questioning look in his eyes, then a pleading one, as if urging me to step back."
    "In oculis eius quaestio est, deinde supplicatio, quasi me retro cedere hortetur."

# game/a2s1.rpy:772
translate latin a2s1_0d38b7f5:

    # "I don't."
    "Non cedo."

# game/a2s1.rpy:773
translate latin a2s1_363610e7:

    # "Instead, I take the final step down onto the floor of the amphitheater, just behind Cassius, moving towards Cato."
    "Ultimum gradum in solum amphitheatri descendo, statim post Cassium, ad Catonem procedens."

# game/a2s1.rpy:774
translate latin a2s1_f137cf03:

    # "But the white wolf continues to celebrate his pretend victory, and he turns with raised paws to face me."
    "Sed lupus albus fictam victoriam celebrare pergit, et manibus sublatis se ad me vertit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:775
translate latin a2s1_1e0ec275:

    # "I see the sudden recognition on his face."
    "Subitam agnitionem in vultu eius video."

# game/a2s1.rpy:776
translate latin a2s1_e9bbe82a:

    # "I run out of options and jam the nervo right into his chest."
    "Nulla alia via relicta est, et Nervo recta pectori eius impingo."

# game/a2s1.rpy:779
translate latin a2s1_4456098b:

    # "Instantly, Cass is shot backwards several feet to crumple next to Amicus, shivering and convulsing."
    "Statim Cass aliquot pedibus retro proicitur et iuxta Amicum corruit, tremens atque convulsus."

# game/a2s1.rpy:780
translate latin a2s1_54adbf4a:

    # "Before I can even turn to Cato though, the old wolf is on me, grabbing the nervo out of my hands and pulling me close by the front of my robes, my teeth clacking together with how fast he does it."
    "Sed antequam me ad Catonem vertere possum, lupus senex me capit, Nervo e manibus meis arripiens et anteriore togae parte me propius trahens; dentes mei tanta celeritate inter se colliduntur."

# game/a2s1.rpy:781
translate latin a2s1_d861d610:

    # "He's looking at the nervo rather than me, though."
    "Sed Nervo, non me, spectat."

# game/a2s1.rpy:783
translate latin a2s1_9f39ffe5:

    # ca "\"Damn it! Thank the gods the idiot didn't have it set on lethal.\""
    ca "\"Maledictum! Dis gratias ago quod stultus illud ad mortiferum gradum non disposuit.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:784
translate latin a2s1_ef4649b8:

    # "Cato fiddles with the device and I realize he's about to use it on me."
    "Cato instrumentum componit; intellego eum mox illo in me usurum esse."

# game/a2s1.rpy:785
translate latin a2s1_1026ec01:

    # "I struggle, kicking at the massive wolf, but he's strong, stronger than even Amicus."
    "Luctor, magnum lupum pedibus feriens; sed fortis est, etiam Amico fortior."

# game/a2s1.rpy:786
translate latin a2s1_fe563373:

    # "But just as he flips the device around, the two metal prongs pointed at my face, I see a paw come over the top of Cato's head."
    "Sed ubi instrumentum vertit, duobus apicibus metallicis ad faciem meam directis, manum supra caput Catonis venire video."

# game/a2s1.rpy:787
translate latin a2s1_67c3f698:

    # "Amicus grips into the metal grating of Cato's face mask, fingers locking into the gaps before he pulls."
    "Amicus cratem metallicam personae Catonis prehendit, digitis in foramina fixis, antequam trahit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:789
translate latin a2s1_dab0bcb2:

    # "Cato screams, and I hear a horrible mix of crunching, tearing, and an electronic hiss as I see red spurt from the old wolf's face for just a moment before he goes down."
    "Cato clamat; horrendam mixturam fragoris, lacerationis stridorisque electronici audio, dum rubrum sanguinem paulisper e facie senis lupi erumpere video, antequam cadit."

# game/a2s1.rpy:790
translate latin a2s1_df40d5f8:

    # "Amicus stares at me with wild eyes as he tries to keep Cato pinned."
    "Amicus me oculis ferocibus intuetur, dum Catonem pressum tenere conatur."

# game/a2s1.rpy:791
translate latin a2s1_963db83c:

    # a "\"[mc], run...run to Neferu! RUN!\""
    a "\"[mc], curre...ad Neferu curre! CURRE!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:792
translate latin a2s1_9930a033:

    # "I stare at Amicus numbly for a moment, a moment in which I want to do so much...but can't, then turn and start to run."
    "Paulisper Amicum torpens intueor; momento illo tam multa facere volo...sed non possum; tum me verto et currere incipio."

# game/a2s1.rpy:793
translate latin a2s1_d2885049:

    # "I run as fast as I can, disappearing behind the trees and bushes, just as I hear Cato yelling for Com to execute me."
    "Quam celerrime curro, post arbores fruticesque evanescens, dum Catonem Computatrum me interficere iubentem audio."

# game/a2s1.rpy:798
translate latin a2s1_fec97169:

    # "To be continued..."
    "Continuabitur..."

